      "value": "<p>At 19th level, the demon hunter becomes so certain of her ability to track infernals that she can track them reliably even under adverse conditions. When tracking infernals with a Survival check, the demon hunter may take 10 even if stress and distractions would normally prevent her from doing so.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/demon-hunter#toc15\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
